    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Envite Posts Grid is an addon for Lhotse theme any Block Theme to display Posts in the grid or list.  Posts Grid addon helps you to build a grid visually as you want to. It is customizable and allows you to change each part of the grid.</p>\n<p>Key Features:<br />\n&#8211; Recent posts, or posts related to the current post (matched by category, tag or any taxonomy<br />\n&#8211; Blog posts and Service pages List  with multiple options<br />\n&#8211; Multi Post types and taxonomies filtering<br />\n&#8211; Enable and Disable Options for Feature Image, Single Meta Data<br />\n&#8211; Fully responsive layouts and customizable</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Rebuilt as a native Gutenberg block (previously an Elementor addon).</li>\n<li>Output is escaped, attributes are validated, and the image link is hidden from screen readers when the title already links to the post.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Envite Posts Grid is an addon for Lhotse theme any Block Theme to display Posts in the grid or list.  Posts Grid addon helps you to build a grid visua …",
